<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP FIFTH ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RUSSIAN CUP FIFTH ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Russian Cup fifth round</p>
<p>matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p> MCS-Selyatino	     1     Dynamo Moscow		 2</p>
<p> Dynamo Stavropol	  3     Zhemchuzhina Sochi	  0</p>
<p> Oryol			 1     Lokomotiv Moscow	    1</p>
<p>(Lokomotiv won 3-1 on penalties)</p>
<p> Metallurg Lipetsk	 1     Torpedo LM Moscow	   3</p>
<p> Rubin Kazan		 1     Lokomotiv Nizhny Novgorod 0</p>
<p> Arsenal Tula		3     Rostselmash Rostov	  0</p>
<p> Kuban Krasnodar	   2     Chernomorets Novorossiisk 1</p>
<p> VVS-Kristall Smolensk   2     Baltika Kaliningrad	 2</p>
<p>(Baltika Kaliningrad won 7-6 on penalites)</p>
<p> Volga Ulyanovsk	   1     Krylya Sovietov Samara    2</p>
<p> Neftekhimik Nizhnekamsk 1     KamAZ Naberezhniye Chelny 3</p>
<p> Shinnik Yaroslavl	 2     Zenit St Petersburg	 3</p>
<p> Lokomotiv Chita	   0     CSKA Moscow		   0</p>
<p>(CSKA Moscow won 4-3 on penalties)</p>
<p>Sixth round to be played on October 18. Spartak Moscow,</p>
<p>Alania Vladikavkaz, Rotor Volgograd and Tom Tomsk are already</p>
<p>through.</p>
